  masthead: "FAYK\xD6Y GAZETES\u0130"
  issue: "Say\u0131 1842"
  price: "Fiyat\u0131 10 TL"
  specialEdition: "DEPREM \xD6ZEL BASKISI"
  editionFormat: "{0}. g\xFCn \xB7 Ak\u015Fam bask\u0131s\u0131"
  fillers:
  - "Fayk\xF6y'de hissedilen deprem eski \xE7ar\u015F\u0131da hasara yol a\xE7t\u0131.
    Ekipler sabaha kadar \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131; toplanma alanlar\u0131nda \xE7orba
    da\u011F\u0131t\u0131ld\u0131."
  - "Uzmanlar zemin et\xFCd\xFC yap\u0131lmadan verilen izinlerin risk ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    hat\u0131rlatt\u0131. Belediye, Deprem Haftas\u0131 boyunca b\xFCt\xFCn binalar\u0131
    yeniden denetleyecek."
  - "Liman yolu trafi\u011Fe kontroll\xFC olarak a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. Okullar hafta
    boyunca tatil edildi. G\xF6n\xFCll\xFCler toplanma alanlar\u0131nda \xE7ocuklara
    oyun kurdu."
  - "Spor: Fayk\xF6yspor'un hafta sonu ma\xE7\u0131 ertelendi. Hava: par\xE7al\u0131
    bulutlu, gece serin."
  adTitle: "DEPREM \xC7ANTASI"
  adLine: "su \xB7 fener \xB7 d\xFCd\xFCk \xB7 ilk yard\u0131m"
  paperTexture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 51bd05b73a7e7a0489caf46a31c3fe8b, type: 3}
